    "global index": "MusicTheoryBench_204",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following statements about chords are correct? ( )\n① There are 2 common chords between C major harmony and c natural minor harmony\n② The Neapolitan sixth chords in C major and c minor are identical\n③ The chords adjacent to the Neapolitan sixth chord are composed of minor third and perfect fourth intervals\n\nOptions: \nA. 0\nB. 1\nC. 2\nD. 3\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
