      "generated_answer": "William W. Kolderup wins the auction for Spencer Island. He outbids his arch-rival, J. R. Taskinar, by purchasing the island for four million dollars. Taskinar, frustrated by his loss, vows vengeance before leaving. \n\nThe final answer is \\boxed{\\text{William W. Kolderup}}.",
