      "generated_answer": "Dr. Capa travels to Los Angeles to restart his life after falling into a deep depression caused by witnessing a patient's suicide. He stays with his friend, Dr. Bob Moore, who invites him to sit in on a group therapy session. This move is intended to help him recover from his trauma and depression. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{To restart his life and recover from depression after witnessing a patient's suicide.}}",
