      "generated_answer": "Luke is forced to deal with issues of sex transformation, arousal by an attractive male, and questions of sexual identity due to his condition. His transformations cause him confusion and anxiety about his identity, further complicated by his interactions with Dr. Catchadourian and Michelle/Max. Ultimately, Luke navigates these challenges to find resolution and acceptance with Michelle, who is also affected by the condition. \n\n\\boxed{{\\text{Sex transformation, sexual arousal confusion, identity crisis, and interactions with others}}}",
