      "generated_answer": "Claire is pressured by her friends to maintain her \"pristine\" virgin appearance, indicating that she faces societal and peer pressure to uphold a certain image and behavior. This becomes evident when her virginity is mentioned as a personal secret she reveals during detention. Ultimately, her actions with John signify her breaking away from this imposed image. \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Claire feels constant pressure from her friends to maintain a \"pristine\" virgin appearance.}}",
      "success": true,
