      "generated_answer": "Stephen feels that the sermons at the religious retreat are directed toward himself. The words describing horrific eternal punishment in hell seem personal to Stephen, overwhelming him and making him desire forgiveness. This personal impact marks a significant point in his internal conflict and spiritual journey.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{himself}}",
      "success": true,
