    "global index": "MMLUPro_history_4710",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: This question refers to the following information.\n\"The seeds of totalitarian regimes are nurtured by misery and want. They spread and grow in the evil soil of poverty and strife. They reach their full growth when the hope of a people for a better life has died. We must keep that hope alive. . . . Great responsibilities have been placed upon us by the swift movement of events. . . . I am confident that the Congress will face these responsibilities squarely.\"\n—President Harry S. Truman, 1947\nThe passage above can best be seen as providing a rationale for\n\nOptions: \nA. the policy of containment.\nB. the start of the Cold War.\nC. the establishment of the United Nations.\nD. participation in the Atlantic Charter.\nE. the creation of NATO.\nF. embarking on a \"roll-back\" of communism.\nG. the principle of \"massive retaliation.\"\nH. the policy of détente.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The passage by Truman emphasizes the need to keep hope alive because misery and want can nurture totalitarian regimes. This rationale directly aligns with the Truman Doctrine, which aimed to support countries threatened by communism and prevent its spread. This doctrine is a foundational element of the broader policy of containment. Although it relates to the context of the Cold War, and could indirectly lead to the creation of NATO or participation in the Atlantic Charter, the core rationale presented is the prevention of totalitarian regimes arising from despair, which is the essence of containment. Détente and massive retaliation are later Cold War policies. Roll-back is a more aggressive strategy than containment.\n\nThe correct answer is \\boxed{A}.",
      "success": true,
      "token_usage": {
        "input_tokens": 259,
        "output_tokens": 136,
        "total_tokens": 395
      },
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "error": null
