      "generated_answer": "Based on the poem and your knowledge of history, Tang relations with western nomadic peoples and frontier peoples relied on which of the following? \n\nThe poem describes ongoing military conscription and campaigns to secure frontier regions, indicating reliance on military strength as a primary strategy.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
